invariant: INV-59
file: mldsa_poly.h
catches: mldsa_test
reason: Decompose rounds r / (2 gamma2) at a quarter of a step where it
  rounds at a half, so near each boundary r1 is one less than FIPS 204
  Algorithm 36 gives. Signatures whose w lands there fail, and
  bin/mldsa_test's comparison with Algorithms 36 and 40 at every input
  finds the inputs.

--- old
    r1 = (r1 * 1025 + (1 << 21)) >> 22;
--- new
    r1 = (r1 * 1025 + (1 << 20)) >> 22;
